title: Doomscrolling
---
Volition: What is he doing?
Goblin-Brain: Don't worry! He's not dead. Its this awesome new thing we found.
Goblin-Brain: I heard its called 'Doomscrolling'
Volition: Doomscrolling... I see...
Volition: Is he learning anything?
Goblin-Brain: Right now he's learning what happens when you submerge an entire brisket in tobasco.
Volition: What happens?
Goblin-Brain: It ruins the brisket.
===
